{"prefectureId":"31","cities":{"31201":[{"id":"31201:national:791e4cefa377","cityId":"31201","category":"文化・名所","text":"「青谷上寺地遺跡」は国指定の史跡です。","source":"https://kunishitei.bunka.go.jp/heritage/detail/401/00003573"},{"id":"31201:national:759109082703","cityId":"31201","category":"文化・名所","text":"「因幡国庁跡」は国指定の史跡です。","source":"https://kunishitei.bunka.go.jp/heritage/detail/401/2135"}],"31202":[{"id":"31202:national:fe74c4d25c6b","cityId":"31202","category":"文化・名所","text":"「青木遺跡」は国指定の史跡です。","source":"https://kunishitei.bunka.go.jp/heritage/detail/401/2134"},{"id":"31202:national:cb102cb039b7","cityId":"31202","category":"地理・自然","text":"市域はほぼ平坦で、米子平野を日野川が流れる。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E7%B1%B3%E5%AD%90%E5%B8%82&oldid=111387059"},{"id":"31202:national:8c77108ab867","cityId":"31202","category":"地域","text":"米子市は、鳥取県の西部に位置する市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E7%B1%B3%E5%AD%90%E5%B8%82&oldid=111387059"}],"31203":[{"id":"31203:national:feda368c4e7c","cityId":"31203","category":"文化・名所","text":"「阿弥大寺古墳群」は国指定の史跡です。","source":"https://kunishitei.bunka.go.jp/heritage/detail/401/2138"},{"id":"31203:national:5e3f91f32158","cityId":"31203","category":"地理・自然","text":"市域の一部は盆地の外側にあり、北条平野の一部になっています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%80%89%E5%90%89%E5%B8%82&oldid=110937574"},{"id":"31203:national:b16a34d8ca5f","cityId":"31203","category":"地域","text":"倉吉市は、鳥取県中部にある市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%80%89%E5%90%89%E5%B8%82&oldid=110937574"}],"31204":[{"id":"31204:national:abce9541f7ea","cityId":"31204","category":"地理・自然","text":"境港市は砂州上に立地しており、平均海抜2mと非常に低く、平坦な土地でもあります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%A2%83%E6%B8%AF%E5%B8%82&oldid=111003621"}],"31302":[{"id":"31302:national:9f11f8bf22b4","cityId":"31302","category":"地理・自然","text":"岩美町には牛ヶ峰山があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%B2%A9%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%BA&oldid=110547485"},{"id":"31302:national:a39569493410","cityId":"31302","category":"地理・自然","text":"岩美町には金峯山があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%B2%A9%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%BA&oldid=110547485"},{"id":"31302:national:1c985d4fd6e4","cityId":"31302","category":"地域","text":"岩美町は、鳥取県の最東端に位置する町です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%B2%A9%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%BA&oldid=110547485"}],"31325":[{"id":"31325:national:a1fc7958d27e","cityId":"31325","category":"地理・自然","text":"若桜町には氷ノ山があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%8B%A5%E6%A1%9C%E7%94%BA&oldid=110014656"},{"id":"31325:national:7906582dec2f","cityId":"31325","category":"地理・自然","text":"若桜町には三室山があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%8B%A5%E6%A1%9C%E7%94%BA&oldid=110014656"},{"id":"31325:national:1a13d7ca6cea","cityId":"31325","category":"地域","text":"若桜町は、鳥取県の東南端に位置する町です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%8B%A5%E6%A1%9C%E7%94%BA&oldid=110014656"}],"31328":[{"id":"31328:national:8db286189d06","cityId":"31328","category":"地域","text":"智頭町は、鳥取県八頭郡に属する町です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%99%BA%E9%A0%AD%E7%94%BA&oldid=110086813"}],"31329":[{"id":"31329:national:4c124b663afb","cityId":"31329","category":"地理・自然","text":"八頭町には扇ノ山があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%85%AB%E9%A0%AD%E7%94%BA&oldid=109991325"},{"id":"31329:national:876a5b9bc21e","cityId":"31329","category":"地理・自然","text":"八頭町には八東川が流れています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%85%AB%E9%A0%AD%E7%94%BA&oldid=109991325"},{"id":"31329:national:8d4db4be97e7","cityId":"31329","category":"地域","text":"八頭町は、鳥取県の東部に位置する町です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%85%AB%E9%A0%AD%E7%94%BA&oldid=109991325"}],"31364":[{"id":"31364:national:4e7f54444ab2","cityId":"31364","category":"歴史","text":"三朝町では震度5強を観測した。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E4%B8%89%E6%9C%9D%E7%94%BA&oldid=111307074"},{"id":"31364:natio